Package: lanshare-qt6
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Description: LAN file transfer application (Qt6)
 LAN Share is a simple cross-platform application for transferring files
 and folders over a local area network without any additional configuration.
 This package provides the Qt6 port of the original LAN-Share project.
 .
 Features:
  - Send one or more files
  - Send entire folders
  - Transfer to multiple receivers simultaneously
  - Pause, resume and cancel transfers
